=== Project Progress Tracker ===

# Mobile App Development Project Analysis

## 1. Overall Project Health Assessment

**Status: MODERATE RISK** ⚠️

| Metric | Status | Assessment |
|--------|--------|------------|
| Schedule Progress | 43.75% | Behind optimal pace |
| Budget Utilization | 60% | On track (early stage) |
| Team Capacity | 5 members | Adequate for current phase |
| Completion Trajectory | 2026-05-12 | ~7 days behind schedule |

**Key Finding:** While UI Design is complete, the project is front-loaded with work. Critical testing and deployment phases haven't started with only ~3 weeks remaining.

---

## 2. Risk Factors & Potential Delays

### High Priority Risks

| Risk | Probability | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|-------------|--------|-----------|
| **Testing bottleneck** | HIGH | CRITICAL | Start parallel testing during API completion |
| **Backend API overruns** | MEDIUM | HIGH | 25% remaining work could extend 5+ days |
| **Insufficient QA time** | HIGH | CRITICAL | Only 10 days allocated for comprehensive testing |
| **Deployment complications** | MEDIUM | MEDIUM | No buffer time before deadline |

### Critical Path Issues
- **Testing phase compressed:** 10 days for full QA cycle is aggressive
- **No overlap:** Sequential workflow prevents parallel work
- **Late-stage discovery:** Bugs found in testing could cascade delays

---

